   "text": "Estimates from the trace: per-step usage isn't logged yet. The €10 after the top-up covers 3 runs: (1) a first attempt that ran\nuntil the output limit (32k) and failed, (2) this run, ≈ $5, (3) ~2 minutes of a run that was stopped by mistake.",
